<%- include('partials/head', { title: 'AI 顾问' }) %>

<section class="page-heading">
  <div>
    <p class="eyebrow">LLM Advisory</p>
    <h1>模型提建议，你来下判断。</h1>
    <p class="lede">顾问为每条建议提供来源、理由和不确定项。接受、修改或拒绝由你决定——不自动写入正式记录。</p>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="advisory-layout">
  <div class="advisory-main">
    <form id="advisory-form" class="form-stack">
      <section class="form-section">
        <div class="section-number">01</div>
        <div class="section-content">
          <h2>场景</h2>
          <p>选择顾问要帮你做什么——点击卡片选中，或者直接用下拉框：</p>
          <select id="useCaseSelect" name="useCase" style="margin-bottom:16px" required>
            <option value="checkin_structure">📋 日常结构化 — 从项目上下文提取候选行动、交付物和停止条件</option>
            <option value="weekly_review_draft">📊 周复盘草稿 — 根据本周记录生成进展摘要和下周建议</option>
            <option value="evidence_relations">🔗 证据关系 — 分析证据记录之间的支持、矛盾或补充关系</option>
            <option value="rule_explanation">📐 规则解释 — 解释已触发规则的输入、逻辑和输出</option>
          </select>
          <p class="current-selection" id="currentCase"><strong>当前选择：</strong>日常结构化 — 从项目上下文中提取候选行动</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="form-section">
        <div class="section-number">02</div>
        <div class="section-content">
          <h2>关联记录</h2>
          <p>顾问只能参考你显式指定的记录。需要从已有记录中复制 UUID 填入。</p>
          <label>记录 ID（逗号分隔）
            <input type="text" name="recordIds" required placeholder="复制下面的 UUID 粘贴到这里" />
            <small>从下方表格复制 <code>id</code> 列的值，多个用英文逗号隔开</small>
          </label>
          <div id="recent-records" class="top-gap">
            <p class="empty">加载已有记录中…</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="form-section">
        <div class="section-number">03</div>
        <div class="section-content">
          <h2>补充说明（可选）</h2>
          <p>用自然语言告诉顾问你的关注点。</p>
          <label>补充指令
            <textarea name="userInstruction" maxlength="2000" rows="3" placeholder="例如：重点关注数据盘更换进度，忽略已闭环事项。帮我看看这几个证据之间有没有矛盾。"></textarea>
            <small><span id="charCount">0</span> / 2000</small>
          </label>
        </div>
      </section>

      <div class="form-actions">
        <button type="submit" class="button primary full">提交顾问请求</button>
        <small id="submit-status" class="submit-feedback"></small>
      </div>
    </form>
  </div>

  <aside class="advisory-sidebar">
    <div class="sticky-card">
      <p class="eyebrow">待处理建议</p>
      <div id="pending-list">
        <p class="loading-text">加载中…</p>
      </div>
      <small style="display:block;margin-top:12px;color:#aebbb4;line-height:1.5">建议状态: pending_user → 你决定 → 接受 / 修改后接受 / 拒绝</small>
    </div>

    <div class="panel top-gap" id="task-detail" style="display:none">
      <div class="panel-heading"><h2>建议详情</h2><button type="button" class="button small secondary" id="close-task-detail">✕</button></div>
      <div id="task-detail-content"></div>
    </div>
  </aside>
</div>

<script src="/static/advisory.js" defer></script>

<%- include('partials/foot') %>
